  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Sultan Selim Fortress: A Timeless Ottoman Legacy in Al Quseir"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nestled in the heart of Al Quseir, the Sultan Selim Fortress stands as a monumental legacy of the Ottoman Empire’s influence in Egypt. Constructed in the 16th century during the reign of its namesake, Sultan Selim, this citadel was originally built to safeguard the flourishing Egyptian trade routes with India. Its strategic importance was such that in 1799, Napoleon Bonaparte’s forces, recognizing its value, fortified it further. They enhanced its defenses by mounting cannons on elevated sections of the walls and adding an observation platform for better surveillance of approaching entities."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The fortress witnessed another significant chapter in its history when British forces, in a fierce confrontation, overpowered Napoleon’s troops. The British contribution to the fortress’s legacy included the construction of a new gateway, marking their triumph and strategic presence in the region."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Despite the inevitable wear and tear over centuries, recent restoration efforts have breathed new life into the Sultan Selim Fortress. These restorations are informed by the detailed illustrations found in the ‘Description de l’Égypte’, a comprehensive record created by French scholars during Napoleon’s Egyptian campaign. The meticulous reconstruction work includes the reinstatement of cannons to their original positions, reviving the fortress’s historic might."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Today, the Sultan Selim Fortress is not just a relic of military architecture but a vibrant cultural hub. Visitors are treated to a rich tapestry of local "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000009"
              ],
              "text": "history and culture"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", with various exhibitions that narrate the region’s storied past. The fortress, now a bridge between past and present, offers a unique glimpse into the diverse layers of history that have shaped Al "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000c"
              ],
              "text": "Quseir"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", making it a must-visit destination for history enthusiasts and cultural explorers alike."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-post-144318-es",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58688",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/image1.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Aerial view of a coastal village with buildings near a shoreline with breaking waves"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Where the Desert Kisses the Sea: A tranquil village by the shore"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/moevenpick-resort-el.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Luxury beachfront patio with stone walls, a hammock, lounge chairs, and a plunge pool overlooking the ocean at sunset"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Experience the epitome of relaxation with this ocean-view patio as the sun dips below the horizon"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
